					"nextDialogs": [
						740850234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740850234,
					"content": "但是，那位來客，十分很忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740850235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740850235,
					"content": "紫東西，偷偷往根去。紫東西，偷偷破壞根。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740850236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740850236,
					"content": "珀西芙，偷偷偷看。珀西芙，偷偷磨石碑。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740850237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740850237,
					"content": "啊！原來是妳把石碑上的字磨掉的！是為了阻止那個傢伙嗎？",
