					"nextDialogs": [
						740850238
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740850238,
					"content": "珀西芙！但是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740850239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740850239,
					"content": "紫東西，還往根去。紫東西，十分很厲害。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740850240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740850240,
					"content": "他找到了別的路？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740850241
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740850241,
					"content": "珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740850242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740850242,
					"content": "看來這傢伙真的有點難對付啊…破壞了根，資訊系統就會失靈，那位來客的感知能力就會受到影響…",
